یو"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Data Type\nڈیٹا ٹائپ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q029","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 03 — Database and Table Operations / ڈیٹابیس اور ٹیبل کے کام","question":"A new student joins and must be added as another row. What are you adding?\nنیا طالب علم آئے اور ایک اور قطار شامل کرنی ہو تو کیا شامل کیا جا رہا ہے؟","options":["New Record\nنیا ریکارڈ","Design View\nڈیزائن ویو","Open\nاوپن","Close\nکلوز"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: New Record\nنیا ریکارڈ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q030","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 03 — Database and Table Operations / ڈیٹابیس اور ٹیبل کے کام","question":"You finished inspecting a table but want the database to remain open. Which action closes that table?\nٹیبل دیکھ لیا لیکن ڈیٹابیس کھلا رکھنا ہے۔ ٹیبل بند کرنے کی کارروائی کیا ہے؟","options":["Close\nکلوز","Design View\nڈیزائن ویو","Open\nاوپن","Save\nسیو"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Close\nکلوز"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q031","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"A field stores employee names such as Ali and Sana. Which type best fits?\nفیلڈ میں Ali اور Sana جیسے ملازمین کے نام ہوں تو کون سی قسم موزوں ہے؟","options":["Short Text\nشارٹ ٹیکسٹ","Number\nنمبر","OLE Object\nاو ایل ای آبجیکٹ","AutoNumber\nآٹو نمبر"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Short Text\nشارٹ ٹیکسٹ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q032","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"A field contains several paragraphs of student remarks. Which type is suitable?\nفیلڈ میں طالب علم کے بارے میں کئی پیراگراف ہوں تو کون سی قسم مناسب ہے؟","options":["Hyperlink\nہائپر لنک","Long Text\nلانگ ٹیکسٹ","Number\nنمبر","OLE Object\nاو ایل ای آبجیکٹ"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Long Text\nلانگ ٹیکسٹ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q033","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"You want to calculate the average of scores stored in a field. Which type supports that purpose?\nفیلڈ میں محفوظ نمبروں کی اوسط نکالنا ہو تو کون سی قسم مناسب ہے؟","options":["Long Text\nلانگ ٹیکسٹ","Number\nنمبر","OLE Object\nاو ایل ای آبجیکٹ","Yes/No\nیس نو"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Number\nنمبر"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q034","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"You need to record the exact joining date of each employee. Which data type should be used?\nہر ملازم کی شمولیت کی تاریخ محفوظ کرنے کے لیے کون سی ڈیٹا ٹائپ ہوگی؟","options":["Number\nنمبر","Short Text\nشارٹ ٹیکسٹ","AutoNumber\nآٹو نمبر","Date/Time\nڈیٹ ٹائم"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Date/Time\nڈیٹ ٹائم"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q035","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"You record prices and fees with monetary formatting. Which data type is intended for this?\nقیمتوں اور فیسوں کو رقم کی شکل میں محفوظ کرنے کے لیے کون سی قسم مناسب ہے؟","options":["Number\nنمبر","AutoNumber\nآٹو نمبر","Currency\nکرنسی","Long Text\nلانگ ٹیکسٹ"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Currency\nکرنسی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q036","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 04 — Field Data Types / فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس","question":"You want Access to assign each new record a number automatically. Which type helps?\nآپ