nked to exactly one personal ID detail record. What relationship fits?\nہر ملازم کے ساتھ صرف ایک شناختی تفصیل کا ریکارڈ ہو تو کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون","Parent Table\nپیرنٹ ٹیبل"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: One-to-One\nون ٹو ون"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q052","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"One customer can place several orders. What relationship best describes it?\nایک گاہک کئی آرڈر دے سکتا ہے۔ یہ کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q053","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Many students enroll in many courses. What underlying relationship is this?\nکئی طلبہ کئی کورسز میں داخل ہوں تو یہ کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Many-to-Many\nمینی ٹو مینی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Many-to-Many\nمینی ٹو مینی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q054","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which key uniquely identifies a record in the original Customers table?\nاصل Customers ٹیبل میں ریکارڈ کو منفرد شناخت کون سی کی دیتی ہے؟","options":["Foreign Key\nفارن کی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q055","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Orders contains CustomerID to link back to Customers. What is CustomerID in Orders?\nOrders ٹیبل میں Customers سے ربط کے لیے CustomerID ہو تو Orders میں یہ کیا ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Foreign Key\nفارن کی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Foreign Key\nفارن کی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q056","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which Access window is used to draw and edit links among tables?\nٹیبلز کے درمیان روابط بنانے اور بدلنے کے لیے کون سی ایکسیس ونڈو استعمال ہوتی ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q057","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which rule helps prevent an order from referring to a nonexistent customer?\nکون سا اصول غیر موجود گاہک کے نام آرڈر بننے سے روکنے میں مدد دیتا ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی","Foreign Key\nفارن کی"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q058","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"For students and courses with many-to-many links, what additional table is often used?\nطلبہ اور کورسز کے مینی ٹو مینی ربط میں اکثر کون سا اضافی ٹیبل اس