rties and Keys / فیلڈ خصوصیات اور کیز","question":"A large table is often searched by roll number. Which property can improve search performance?\nبڑے ٹیبل میں رول نمبر سے اکثر تلاش ہوتی ہے۔ کون سی خصوصیت تلاش تیز کر سکتی ہے؟","options":["Input Mask\nان پٹ ماسک","Indexed\nانڈیکسڈ","Caption\nکیپشن","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Indexed\nانڈیکسڈ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q048","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 05 — Field Properties and Keys / فیلڈ خصوصیات اور کیز","question":"A phone number must follow a consistent typing pattern. Which property can guide data entry?\nفون نمبر ایک ہی ترتیب میں لکھوانا ہو تو کون سی خصوصیت مدد کرے گی؟","options":["Input Mask\nان پٹ ماسک","Format\nفارمیٹ","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","Caption\nکیپشن"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Input Mask\nان پٹ ماسک"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q049","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 05 — Field Properties and Keys / فیلڈ خصوصیات اور کیز","question":"The column stored as DOB should display Birth Date to users. Which property changes its displayed label?\nDOB کالم صارف کو Birth Date کے نام سے دکھانا ہو تو کون سی خصوصیت بدلے گی؟","options":["Format\nفارمیٹ","Caption\nکیپشن","Required\nریکوائرڈ","Indexed\nانڈیکسڈ"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Caption\nکیپشن"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q050","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 05 — Field Properties and Keys / فیلڈ خصوصیات اور کیز","question":"You want a note explaining why a field exists in table design. Where can you put it?\nٹیبل ڈیزائن میں فیلڈ کے مقصد کی وضاحت لکھنی ہو تو کہاں لکھیں گے؟","options":["Field Size\nفیلڈ سائز","Default Value\nڈیفالٹ ویلیو","Description\nڈسکرپشن","Caption\nکیپشن"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Description\nڈسکرپشن"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q051","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Each employee is linked to exactly one personal ID detail record. What relationship fits?\nہر ملازم کے ساتھ صرف ایک شناختی تفصیل کا ریکارڈ ہو تو کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون","Parent Table\nپیرنٹ ٹیبل"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: One-to-One\nون ٹو ون"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q052","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"One customer can place several orders. What relationship best describes it?\nایک گاہک کئی آرڈر دے سکتا ہے۔ یہ کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q053","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Many students enroll in many courses. What underlying relationship is this?\nکئی طلبہ کئی کورسز میں داخل ہوں تو یہ کون سا ربط ہے؟","options":["Many-to-Many\nمینی ٹو مینی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Many-to-Many\nمینی ٹو مینی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q054","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which key uniquely identifies a record in the original Customers table?\nاصل Customers ٹیبل میں ریکارڈ کو منفرد شناخت کون سی کی دیتی ہے؟","options":["Foreign Key\nفارن کی","One-to-One\nون ٹو ون","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q055","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Orders contains CustomerID to link back to Customers. What is CustomerID in Orders?\nOrders ٹیبل میں Customers سے ربط کے لیے CustomerID ہو تو Orders میں یہ کیا ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Foreign Key\nفارن کی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Foreign Key\nفارن کی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q056","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which Access window is used to draw and edit links among tables?\nٹیبلز کے درمیان روابط بنانے اور بدلنے کے لیے کون سی ایکسیس ونڈو استعمال ہوتی ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q057","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Which rule helps prevent an order from referring to a nonexistent customer?\nکون سا اصول غیر موجود گاہک کے نام آرڈر بننے سے روکنے میں مدد دیتا ہے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو","One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی","Foreign Key\nفارن کی"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q058","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"For students and courses with many-to-many links, what additional table is often used?\nطلبہ اور کورسز کے مینی ٹو مینی ربط میں اکثر کون سا اضافی ٹیبل استعمال ہوتا ہے؟","options":["One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی","Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل","Foreign Key\nفارن کی","Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Junction Table\nجنکشن ٹیبل"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q059","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"The Customers table provides the unique CustomerID referenced by Orders. What role does Customers play?\nCustomers ٹیبل منفرد CustomerID دیتا ہے جسے Orders استعمال کرتا ہے۔ Customers کا کردار کیا ہے؟","options":["One-to-Many\nون ٹو مینی","Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Parent Table\nپیرنٹ ٹیبل","Relationships Window\nریلیشن شپ ونڈو"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Parent Table\nپیرنٹ ٹیبل"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q060","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 06 — Table Relationships / ٹیبل ریلیشن شپ","question":"Two tables are joined on matching IDs. What can the second linked table be called?\nدو ٹیبلز مشترک شناخت سے جڑے ہوں تو دوسرے جڑے ٹیبل کو کیا کہیں گے؟","options":["Referential Integrity\nریفرینشل انٹیگریٹی","Many-to-Many\nمینی ٹو مینی","Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Related Table\nمتعلقہ ٹیبل"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q061","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 07 — Forms and Data Entry / فارم اور ڈیٹا انٹری","question":"A receptionist needs a simple screen instead of a raw table for entering visitors. Which object should be built?\nریسیپشنسٹ کو خام ٹیبل کے بجائے آسان اندراج سکرین چاہیے۔ کون سا آبجیکٹ بنے گا؟","options":["Form Wiza