-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 09 — Reports and Queries / رپورٹس اور کوئریز","question":"The results of a query must become a separate new table. Which query is appropriate?\nکوئری کے نتائج کو الگ نیا ٹیبل بنانا ہو تو کون سی کوئری مناسب ہے؟","options":["Select Query\nسلیکٹ کوئری","Make Table Query\nمیک ٹیبل کوئری","Report\nرپورٹ","Query\nکوئری"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Make Table Query\nمیک ٹیبل کوئری"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q089","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 09 — Reports and Queries / رپورٹس اور کوئریز","question":"A query should return only students in class 10. What part defines this restriction?\nکوئری صرف دسویں کلاس کے طلبہ دکھائے تو یہ پابندی کس حصے میں دی جاتی ہے؟","options":["Query Criteria\nکوئری کرائیٹیریا","Append Query\nاپینڈ کوئری","Select Query\nسلیکٹ کوئری","Report\nرپورٹ"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Query Criteria\nکوئری کرائیٹیریا"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q090","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 09 — Reports and Queries / رپورٹس اور کوئریز","question":"The printed report needs headings and fields in the correct positions. What should be adjusted?\nپرنٹ شدہ رپورٹ میں عنوان اور فیلڈز کی جگہ درست کرنی ہو تو کیا بدلیں گے؟","options":["Report Layout\nرپورٹ لے آؤٹ","Delete Query\nڈیلیٹ کوئری","Append Query\nاپینڈ کوئری","Make Table Query\nمیک ٹیبل کوئری"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Report Layout\nرپورٹ لے آؤٹ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q091","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"Where do you find commands for adding a new table to the database?\nڈیٹابیس میں نیا ٹیبل بنانے کی کمانڈز کہاں ملیں گی؟","options":["Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ","Create Tab\nکری ایٹ ٹیب","Data Type\nڈیٹا ٹائپ","Save Table\nسیو ٹیبل"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Create Tab\nکری ایٹ ٹیب"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q092","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"You want to choose field names and types before typing data. Which creation method fits?\nڈیٹا درج کرنے سے پہلے فیلڈ کے نام اور اقسام منتخب کرنا ہوں تو کون سا طریقہ درست ہے؟","options":["Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو","Table Design\nٹیبل ڈیزائن","Design View\nڈیزائن ویو","New Field\nنیو فیلڈ"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Table Design\nٹیبل ڈیزائن"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q093","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"You are naming a column StudentAge. Which part of the field definition do you edit?\nکالم کا نام StudentAge رکھنا ہو تو فیلڈ کی کون سی تعریف بدلیں گے؟","options":["Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم","Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ","Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو","New Field\nنیو فیلڈ"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q094","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"You want the Age column to accept numeric data. Which property determines its basic kind?\nAge کالم میں عددی ڈیٹا رکھنا ہو تو اس کی بنیادی قسم کون سی خصوصیت مقرر کرتی ہے؟","options":["Save Table\nسیو ٹیبل","Table Design\nٹیبل ڈیزائن","Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم","Data Type\nڈیٹا ٹائپ"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Data Type\nڈیٹا ٹائپ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q095","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"Every record must be identified by its own unique number. Which table setting should be assigned?\nہر ریکارڈ کی شناخت منفرد نمبر سے ہونی چاہیے۔ کون سی سیٹنگ استعمال ہوگی؟","options":["Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو","Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ","New Field\nنیو فیلڈ","Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Primary Key\nپرائمری کی"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q096","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"After defining a table, which view shows data in rows and columns for entry?\nٹیبل کی ساخت بنانے کے بعد قطاروں اور کالموں میں ڈیٹا درج کرنے کے لیے کون سا ویو ہوگا؟","options":["Data Type\nڈیٹا ٹائپ","New Field\nنیو فیلڈ","Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم","Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q097","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"A field type needs correcting in an existing table. Which view is used to change it?\nموجودہ ٹیبل میں فیلڈ کی قسم درست کرنی ہو تو کون سا ویو استعمال ہوگا؟","options":["Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم","Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو","Save Table\nسیو ٹیبل","Design View\nڈیزائن ویو"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Correct answer: Design View\nڈیزائن ویو"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q098","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"What action preserves the structure of a table you have just created?\nابھی بنائے گئے ٹیبل کی ساخت محفوظ کرنے کے لیے کیا عمل کریں گے؟","options":["Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو","Design View\nڈیزائن ویو","Save Table\nسیو ٹیبل","Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Correct answer: Save Table\nسیو ٹیبل"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q099","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"A school starts recording student email addresses in addition to names. What is added to the table?\nسکول ناموں کے ساتھ ای میل بھی محفوظ کرنا شروع کرے تو ٹیبل میں کیا اضافہ ہوگا؟","options":["New Field\nنیو فیلڈ","Table Design\nٹیبل ڈیزائن","Field Name\nفیلڈ نیم","Datasheet View\nڈیٹا شیٹ ویو"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Correct answer: New Field\nنیو فیلڈ"},{"id":"dit-access-nov11-q100","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":12,"topic":"Section 10 — Creating and Editing Tables / ٹیبل بنانا اور ترمیم","question":"An obsolete column is no longer needed in a table. Which action removes it?\nٹیبل میں پرانا غیر ضروری کالم ہٹانا ہو تو کون سا عمل کیا جائے گا؟","options":["Primary Key\nپرائمری کی","Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ","New Field\nنیو فیلڈ","Table Design\nٹیبل ڈیزائن"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Correct answer: Delete Field\nڈیلیٹ فیلڈ"}]'::jsonb) src WHERE EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.mcqs t WHERE t.id=src->>'id' AND to_jsonb(t) @> src))<>760 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'mcqs read-back mismatch'; END IF; END $verify$;
DO $guard$ DECLARE src JSONB; BEGIN FOR src IN SELECT value FROM jsonb_array_elements('[{"id":"dit-nov11-networking-devices-mcq-notes","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":6,"chapter_title":"Networking Devices","title":"Networking Devices: MCQ Revision Notes","description":"100 supplied English and Urdu questions across 10 topics, with highlighted answers and a complete answer key.","pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/networking-devices.pdf","preview_pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/networking-devices.pdf","file_size":"723 KB","download_count":0,"last_updated":"2026-11-11","action_button_text":null,"action_button_url":null,"content":"## About these revision notes\n\nThis document contains the supplied Networking Devices practice question bank for D.I.T Semester 1 Computer Science, in the Computer Networking book. It preserves 100 questions, their source option order, the English and Urdu wording supplied in the document, and the verified correct answers. Technical literals such as addresses, formulas and acronyms are retained exactly where the source uses them. This is revision material, not an official examination paper or a complete theory textbook.\n\n## Topics\n\n- 3.1 Node — Network Nodes / نیٹ ورک نوڈز\n- 3.2 Network Interface Card (NIC) / نیٹ ورک انٹرفیس کارڈ\n- 3.3 Modem / موڈیم\n- 3.4 Hub / ہب\n- 3.5 Switch / سوئچ\n- 3.6 Wireless Networking Devices / وائرلیس نیٹ ورکنگ ڈیوائسز\n- 3.6.1 Wireless Access Point (WAP) / وائرلیس ایکسس پوائنٹ\n- 3.6.2 Wireless USB Adapter / وائرلیس USB اڈاپٹر\n- 3.6.3 Wireless LAN (WLAN) / وائرلیس LAN\n- 3.7.1 Router / راؤٹر\n\n## Study one topic at a time\n\nFirst attempt each question without looking at its highlighted answer. Compare the English and Urdu wording where both are provided. Explain why the other options do not fit, and keep a short list of concepts to revisit. The PDF deliberately includes highlighted correct options and an answer key for revision. Online tests keep their existing answer and result behaviour.\n\n## Preview and download\n\nUse the PDF viewer on this page or download the same document for offline study. The PDF embeds its Urdu font and retains all questions from the supplied bank.\n\n## Continue practising\n\nOpen [Computer Science MCQs](/classes/dit-intermediate/dit-computer-science/mcqs/) and select the matching book, chapter and topic. Find the other chapters under [Computer Science notes](/classes/dit-intermediate/dit-computer-science/notes/)."},{"id":"dit-nov11-transmission-media-mcq-notes","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":7,"chapter_title":"Transmission Media","title":"Transmission Media: MCQ Revision Notes","description":"110 supplied English and Urdu questions across 11 topics, with highlighted answers and a complete answer key.","pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/transmission-media.pdf","preview_pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/transmission-media.pdf","file_size":"774 KB","download_count":0,"last_updated":"2026-11-11","action_button_text":null,"action_button_url":null,"content":"## About these revision notes\n\nThis document contains the supplied Transmission Media practice question bank for D.I.T Semester 1 Computer Science, in the Computer Networking book. It preserves 110 questions, their source option order, the English and Urdu wording supplied in the document, and the verified correct answers. Technical literals such as addresses, formulas and acronyms are retained exactly where the source uses them. This is revision material, not an official examination paper or a complete theory textbook.\n\n## Topics\n\n- 1. Transmission Media and Wired Communication\n- 2. Coaxial Cable: Structure and Uses\n- 3. Coaxial Ethernet: 10BASE2, 10BASE5 and 10BASE-T\n- 4. BNC Connectors and Coaxial Network Connections\n- 5. Twisted Pair Cable and UTP\n- 6. UTP Categories and RJ45 Connectors\n- 7. Shielded Twisted Pair (STP)\n- 8. Fiber-Optic Cable and Its Construction\n- 9. Single-Mode and Multi-Mode Fiber\n- 10. Wireless Media and Communication Technologies\n- 11. Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, WLAN and Wireless Devices\n\n## Study one topic at a time\n\nFirst attempt each question without looking at its highlighted answer. Compare the English and Urdu wording where both are provided. Explain why the other options do not fit, and keep a short list of concepts to revisit. The PDF deliberately includes highlighted correct options and an answer key for revision. Online tests keep their existing answer and result behaviour.\n\n## Preview and download\n\nUse the PDF viewer on this page or download the same document for offline study. The PDF embeds its Urdu font and retains all questions from the supplied bank.\n\n## Continue practising\n\nOpen [Computer Science MCQs](/classes/dit-intermediate/dit-computer-science/mcqs/) and select the matching book, chapter and topic. Find the other chapters under [Computer Science notes](/classes/dit-intermediate/dit-computer-science/notes/)."},{"id":"dit-nov11-network-models-mcq-notes","class_slug":"dit-intermediate","subject_slug":"dit-computer-science","chapter_number":8,"chapter_title":"Network Models","title":"Network Models: MCQ Revision Notes","description":"150 supplied English and Urdu questions across 15 topics, with highlighted answers and a complete answer key.","pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/network-models.pdf","preview_pdf_url":"https://raytechinstitute.com/documents/dit/nov11/network-models.pdf","file_size":"1031 KB","download_count":0,"last_updated":"2026-11-11","action_button_text":null,"action_button_url":null,"content":"## About these revision notes\n\nThis document contains the supplied Network Models practice question bank for D.I.T Semester 1 Computer Science, in the Computer Networking book. It preserves 150 questions, their source option order, the English 